{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06HV", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-factor-small-extension}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-smoothness-small-extensions}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4c90c8db38bbf7198913ed337f7d354cdef469fc3cdd43f7d0871b20244029e5", "source_text": "Proof omitted. Hints: apply Lemma <REF_0001>\nand use induction similar to the proof of\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:024b4abb85bd975581f0bb52516b88a592ea0ef7bdcc0a91deee65cc87651ace", "unit_id": "tag:06HX:proof"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "06HV", "placeholders": {"ITEMCLOSE_0001": "]", "ITEMCLOSE_0002": "]", "ITEMOPEN_0001": "\\item [", "ITEMOPEN_0002": "\\item [", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$F: \\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda \\to\n\\textit{Sets}$", "MATH_0003": "$A_1 \\to A$", "MATH_0004": "$A_2 \\to A$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0006": "$A_2 \\to A$", "MATH_0007": "$F(A_1 \\times_A A_2) \\to F(A_1) \\times_{F(A)} F(A_2)$", "MATH_0008": "$A \\to k$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0010": "$F(A \\times_k k[\\epsilon]) \\to F(A) \\times_{F(k)} F(k[\\epsilon])$", "MATH_0011": "$F(A \\times_k k[\\epsilon]) \\to F(A) \\times_{F(k)} F(k[\\epsilon])$", "REF_0001": "\\cite{Sch}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-compare-S1-S2-schlessinger}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d1864b02d0623909c39632af199408938094c2b1b636d3d76205a9a5ad11bd64", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:493896240cdca46b9a51bbce905f009c2be9aa9b91fbdb43c55d35e9e82ab10e", "source_text": "When <MATH_0001> is cofibered in sets, conditions (S1) and (S2) are exactly\nconditions (H1) and (H2) from Schlessinger's paper <REF_0001>.\nNamely, for a functor <MATH_0002>, conditions (S1) and (S2) state:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(S1)<ITEMCLOSE_0001> If <MATH_0003> and <MATH_0004> are maps in\n<MATH_0005> with <MATH_0006> surjective, then the induced\nmap <MATH_0007> is\nsurjective.\n<ITEMOPEN_0002>(S2)<ITEMCLOSE_0002>  If <MATH_0008> is a map in <MATH_0009>, then the\ninduced map\n<MATH_0010>\nis bijective.\n<STRUCT_0002>\nThe injectivity of the map\n<MATH_0011>\ncomes from the second part of condition (S2) and the fact that morphisms\nare identities.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:061920418b2e0ee1d79a2cca01dcc2607a5b1bf6fe1a9ee08b90dda55be6f0de", "unit_id": "tag:06HY:statement"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06HV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$k[\\epsilon]$", "MATH_0005": "$k[V]$", "MATH_0006": "$k$", "MATH_0007": "$V$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-S2-extensions}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:654d552d6eb8e4ea4c9473da9dbd0952c4552daff479d3b0e7fd828debbb8ea8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3771001bd5bac1b285a7cff2f7af6806520bb9634a1d980db8b21aab2a0dd8c8", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category cofibred in groupoids over\n<MATH_0002>. If <MATH_0003> satisfies (S2), then the\ncondition of (S2) also holds when <MATH_0004> is replaced by <MATH_0005>\nfor any finite dimensional <MATH_0006>-vector space <MATH_0007>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:252d109e39200e0e375f5e777d661619d84329dbc9353859a992d679a07455db", "unit_id": "tag:06HZ:statement"}
